      "content": "hey, i'm stuck on an iam issue. i'm trying to let a lambda function write logs to an s3 bucket but im just getting \"access denied\" errors even though i thought i added the policy right. can u check this json for me?\n\n{\n  \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n  \"Statement\": [\n    {\n      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n      \"Action\": [\n        \"s3:PutObject\"\n      ],\n      \"Resource\": \"arn:aws:s3:::my-company-logs/*\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
